{"id":45197,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-amadora-2025\/"},"modified":"2026-10-10T14:28:44","modified_gmt":"2026-10-10T13:28:44","slug":"sao-silvestre-amadora","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-amadora\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre da Amadora 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre da Amadora 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre da Amadora 2026<\/strong> (51\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se a <strong>31 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (Quinta-feira).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partidas agendadas a partir das <strong>16:00<\/strong> (Corrida das Crian\u00e7as) e a prova principal de <strong>10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong> na <strong>Pra\u00e7a S\u00e3o Silvestre<\/strong>, no concelho da <strong>Amadora<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>), esta m\u00edtica corrida \u00e9 organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal da Amadora<\/strong> e pela <strong>HMS Sports<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CA